@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<div class="container mt-5">
    <div class="p-5 mb-4 bg-light rounded-3 border">
        <div class="container-fluid py-5">
            <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-success">Middleware & Razor Pages Submission</h1>
            <p class="col-md-8 fs-4 mt-3 text-secondary">
                Welcome to the Wipro NGA Module 04 training project. This application demonstrates 
                <strong>Custom Middleware Pipeline Configurations</strong> alongside <strong>Advanced Razor Pages</strong> 
                using strongly typed Page Models and in-memory lists.
            </p>
            <hr class="my-4" />
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <a asp-page="/Items/Index" class="btn btn-success btn-lg">Explore Items Catalog</a>
                <a asp-page="/Items/Create" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-lg">Add New Item</a>
                <a href="/index.html" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg">Test Static HTML Page</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row align-items-stretch mt-4">
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
            <div class="h-100 p-4 border bg-white rounded-3 shadow-sm">
                <h3 class="text-success">Part 1: Custom Middlewares</h3>
                <ul class="mt-3">
                    <li><strong>Request & Response Logging:</strong> Intercepts and logs request method, path, and status code to console log files.</li>
                    <li><strong>Security Headers CSP:</strong> Adds a Content-Security-Policy header to secure resources against XSS.</li>
                    <li><strong>Static Files Delivery:</strong> Serves standard HTML, CSS, and JS assets directly from the <code>wwwroot</code> folder.</li>
                    <li><strong>Custom Exception Handler:</strong> Redirects unhandled errors to a designated <code>/Error</code> page.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
            <div class="h-100 p-4 border bg-white rounded-3 shadow-sm">
                <h3 class="text-success">Part 2: Razor Pages</h3>
                <ul class="mt-3">
                    <li><strong>Dynamic Catalog:</strong> Renders lists dynamically using standard C# loop structures.</li>
                    <li><strong>Form Property Binding:</strong> Leverages strongly bound parameters using the <code>[BindProperty]</code> page model attribute.</li>
                    <li><strong>Data Form Validation:</strong> Enforces C# validation attributes and displays intuitive UI helper badges.</li>
                    <li><strong>In-Memory Collections:</strong> Demonstrates persistent data state across post submissions without needing databases.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
